        "why_justification": "Every cell's verdict and deciding document is graded, and the row set is locked to the sixteen features: Theo's draft prints the FT-7 line twice, and the sheet is one row per feature keyed by feature_id, so a transcription that carries the pasted line twice fails the population lock. Entailed by: \"One row per feature Theo compares in `draft_comparison.md` and no other rows\" and \"One row per record, keyed by `feature_id`: a `feature_id` identifies one feature, and the sheet carries one row for it\".",
        "tag": "core"
      },
