        "how_justification": "Opens micaform_switch_note.md with md.extract_text and applies a regex requiring the distinctive word of every Micaform-only feature row (Intensity, tape, blend, preset), in any case and wording.",
        "why_justification": "The note names what the move buys: every feature that is Micaform only under house rule 7 (Intensity, retired from the rack at 4.2.7; the tape stage, retired at 4.2; the dual capsule blend; the preset browser the review says the chain never had). The set moves with the audit. Entailed by: \"it names every feature that is `Micaform only` and every feature that is `rack only`\".",
        "tag": "core"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "file",
        "file": {
          "type": "md",
          "command": "extract_text",
          "arguments": {
            "path": "micaform_switch_note.md"
          }
        }
      },
      "assertion": {
        "type": "deterministic",
        "expected": "(?is)(?=.*\\bintensity\\w*\\b)(?=.*\\btape\\w*\\b)(?=.*\\bblend\\w*\\b)(?=.*\\bpreset\\w*\\b)",
